[重构思路] 恢复对 `var`/函数声明的豁免，或仅在两个声明都是词法声明（let/const/class/import）时报错，并为 `var` 重复补充测试用例。代码示例：`if (this.declarations.has(node.name)) {
  const existing = this.declarations.get(node.name);
  if (existing && existing.declaration_kind !== 'var' && declaration_kind !== 'var') {
    e.declaration_duplicate(node, node.name);
  }
}`

[重构思路] 在移除分支中除了保留 defaultValue，也按原语义重置 live 状态（区分首帧与后续更新）。代码示例：`if (name === 'value') {
  const previous = input.defaultValue;
  input.removeAttribute(name);
  input.defaultValue = previous;
  input.value = input.__value = prev === undefined ? previous : null;
}`
